WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
Made and sold by Juice Xuanguo

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:03,720
It's all your business alone

3
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:06,200
This red envelope is worth a lot of money.

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,480
Thank you for your hard work during this time

5
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,920
Take what you have to take

6
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:11,510
Thank you, brother. Please take a look at the store.

7
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:20,100
I still have to go out

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,220
I always feel that the boss is too kind to us

9
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:24,680
On the contrary, I don’t know how to repay

10
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,440
It’s not easy to repay

11
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:30,420
How to repay brother? Who cares? You still don’t know, right?

12
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,380
I gave Yu Yu a gift and he was happy.

13
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,420
The boss must also be happy, Brother Dashan

14
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:36,100
I didn't expect your brain to be so good.

15
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,780
The figure you gave me is seriously inconsistent

16
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:40,940
Ever since I was a child, people around me have thought that I was fast-paced and brainless.

17
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,060
But in fact, I am a smart group
